] , [
    netex:position 11 ; netex:element "PrimaryMode"
] , [
    netex:position 12 ; netex:element "CustomerServiceContactDetails"
] .
## CEN PROPOSAL: was netex:Operator, now Organisation (same elements)

## --- privateCodes/PrivateCode[@type] — known type values ---
